{"projectInfo":{"name":"DS-Lite隧道典型配置举例","path":"dslite","visibility":2,"categoryId":599,"introduction":"运行IPv4协议的私网Private IPv4 network和公网IPv4 network通过IPv6网络相连。通过在B4设备（Router A）和AFTR（Router B）之间建立DS-Lite隧道，并在AFTR连接IPv4 network接口上配置NAT，实现IPv4私网主机穿越IPv6网络访问IPv4公网。","label":["DS-Lite","隧道"]},"deviceInfoList":[{"resourceName":"IPv4-Host-A","resourceCategory":"路由器","resourceModel":"MSR36-20","resourceVersion":"CMW7.1.064-R0821P11","configPath":"DeviceConfig\\IPv4-Host-A.cfg"},{"resourceName":"IPv4-Host-B","resourceCategory":"路由器","resourceModel":"MSR36-20","resourceVersion":"CMW7.1.064-R0821P11","configPath":"DeviceConfig\\IPv4-Host-B.cfg"},{"resourceName":"AFTR","resourceCategory":"路由器","resourceModel":"MSR36-20","resourceVersion":"CMW7.1.064-R0821P11","configPath":"DeviceConfig\\AFTR.cfg"},{"resourceName":"B4","resourceCategory":"路由器","resourceModel":"MSR36-20","resourceVersion":"CMW7.1.064-R0821P11","configPath":"DeviceConfig\\B4.cfg"}]}